'''Fishing''' is a [[Gathering skills|gathering skill]] which involves catching fish. Higher Fishing levels allow for the utilisation of different mechanisms of Fishing as well as the ability to catch a larger selection of fish. Caught fish may be cooked through the [[Cooking]] skill to create food which may be used to regain health during combat. 

