===Cape of Accomplishment===
For players with level 99 Fishing, a [[Fishing cape]] can be bought from the [[Master fisher]] standing inside the [[Fishing Guild]]. The cape will cost 99,000 coins, like all other [[Cape of Achievement|Capes of Achievement]]. If Fishing is a player's only mastered skill, they will have an untrimmed cape. If the player has 99 in any other skill, it will sport a gold trim.
The Fishing cape's perk provides a chance to gain an additional catch. No experience is given for the additional catch.

