;high- and lowchance multipliers
The third type affects both highchance and lowchance. This is exclusively the [[Honed]] perk, which increases both high- and lowchance by multiplying by <math>(1 + rank \times 0.02)</math>. Additionally, Honed is different to the above boosts as it also rounds up, rather than down.

;Additions
The fourth type is [[Temporary_skill_boost#Invisible_boosts|invisible level boosts]], which exclusively come from familiars and the [[Ring of Whispers]]. Effectively acts as adding to your Fishing level, though it is calculated slightly differently. The calculated familiarChanceBuff is added to both highchance and lowchance, after the multipliers.

<math>familiarChanceBuff = \left \lfloor ( familiarBoost \times \left \lfloor 10 \times ( highchance - lowchance ) / 98 \right \rfloor / 10 ) \right \rfloor</math>

